From: TokyoDanInJapan <254110859+TokyoDanInJapan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:03:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Add GitHub Universe badge board with button and tilt
 controls

- New universe_badge board (custom Tufty 2350): Explorer LCD pins,
  six GPIO buttons, LSM6DS3TR-C on i2c1 (GPIO18/19, 0x6a), POWER_EN latch.
- Skip Explorer PWM audio and QwSTPad I2C, whose pins are VBUS_DETECT,
  CAP_ALERT and IMU_INT on the badge.
- Tilt forward/back walks, tilt left/right turns; level is captured at
  start and whenever the menu closes. Buttons switch to menu keys in menus.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
